  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EST 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hamani ogokora omoroberio bw’ogoita Abayahudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’amang’ana ayio, omorwoti Ahaswero agakinia Hamani, mosinto o Hamedata Omoagagi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", akamoa obonene kobua abanene bande bonsi abarenge amo nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akarua ogochika ng’a abasomba baye bonsi barenge kobeera ase egeita kiaye batung’ame bosio bwa Hamani ase okomosasiima. Bonsi bagakora bo, korende Moredekai ere akanga gokora bo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abasomba bande b’omorwoti abarenge kobeera agwo ase egeita bakabooria Moredekai, Inee! “Nase ki kwangire koigwera ogochika kw’omorwoti?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaba bagokwana nere rituko ase rituko ng’a aigwere ogochika koria, korende tabeete ogotegerera amang’ana abo. Ere abateebia “inche n’Omoyahudi naende tingotung’amera Hamani”. Ase ayio abasomba baria bagateebia Hamani, erinde barore gose amang’ana a Moredekai nancherwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani akaba nendamwamu enene mono ekero aroche ng’a Moredekai tarenge gotung’ama ase okomosasiima,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ekero amanyete ng’a Moredekai n’Omoyahudi orenge, akarora ng’a tari Moredekai bweka arae egesusuro, korende ere akaria eira goita Abayahudi bonsi abarenge ase oborwoti bw’Ahaswero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o ikomi na kabere bw’okogamba kw’omorwoti Ahaswero, omotienyi bw’eritang’ani okorokwa Nisani, Hamani akarwa ogochika obomera bagoakwa obwo bware korokwa Puri, erio banyore rituko na omotienyi arenge gocha goikerania ebirengererio biaye biogoita Abayahudi, erio bagaikera rituko ria ikomi na gatato r’omotienyi o ikomi na kabere okorokwa Adari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hamani agateebia omorwoti Ahaswero, “Mbare aa abanto b’egesaku gete besiarerete, bamenyete ase egati y’abanto be chingongo chionsi chi’oborwoti bwao. Amachiiko ’abaanto abwo nigo are nogwatananeka korwa ase amachiiko ’abaanto bande. Barabwo tibari korenda amachiiko ao, aye omorwoti. Ase ayio, aye omorwoti, okoremereria koba nabaanto aba tigokorenta bitoki binde ebiya asore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti, amang’ana aya karakogwenere, karue ogochika ng’a abanto aba baitwe basirigwe kegima. Onye nabo nindete chifeta chitalanta chilifu ikomi (10,000) ne chifeta echio nigo chirabeekwe ase ekungo yao, aye omorwoti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti akarusia ebonyi yarenge ase ekiara kiaye gi’okoboko, yabwate ekemanyererio kiaye, akayea omobisa oria bw’Abayahudi, Hamani, mosinto o Hamedata, Omoagagi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agateebia Hamani, “Chibesa echio gwachieirwe, na abanto kwabaeirwe, okore ande onsi orarore akogwenerete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, ase rituko ria ikomi na gatato, ri’omotienyi bw’eritang’ani, Hamani akarangeria abariki b’omorwoti erio akabateebia, barike amang’ana ’ogochika koria omorwoti aruete bayaonchore ase kera omonwa na kera engencho yokorika ase oborwoti bwonsi erio bayatome gochia ase abagaambi abanene b’oborwoti, na ase abagabana, na ase abanene b’abaanto be chingongo chionsi ase oborwoti bwaye. Amang’ana ayio nigo arigetwe akabeekwa erieta ri’omorwoti Ahaswero amo nekemanyererio ki’ebonyi eria yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amarube aria akaegwa abanto abaango bakayaminyokia gochia ase chingongo chionsi chiare ase oborwoti boria. Nigo arenge goteeba ng’a ase rituko erimo rioka, rituko ria ikomi na gatato ri’omotienyi o ikomi na kabere, noro Adari, Abayahudi bonsi, abanto abake na abagotu, abakungu na abana, baitwe tibarorerwa mabeera basirigwe pi, na ebinto biabo bisakorwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ’amarube ayio achikirwe nigo abegetwe maiso marore ase chingongo chionsi ase obogambi boria koraareria abanto bonsi bebeeke ang’e goika rituko riria riike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase Ogochika koria kw’omorwoti amang’ana ayio akabeekwa maiso marore ase eburi ya Susa, gokabetereria abanto baria abaango baminyoka gochia ase chingongo chionsi. Erio omorwoti na Hamani bagaikaransa konywa, korende omochie o Susa okaba nogoichana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
